  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.27 Mental disorder",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.27 “Mental disorder” means a condition defined in the current edition of the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders of the American Psychiatric Association diagnosed by a psychologist or psychiatrist, based upon mental status examination or psychological testing.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00; ss by #8925, eff 7-1-07",
